@startuml
title UI-01 durable studio operation observer — DRAFT
actor Human
participant "Owning studio" as Studio
participant "Existing OperationsTracker" as Tracker
participant "Project Service" as API
database "Persisted operation" as DB
Studio -> API : command with request key
API -> DB : claim operation / persist state
API --> Studio : operation identity or uncertain response
Studio -> Tracker : follow owning project/session/key
Human -> Studio : navigate away / reload
Tracker -> API : authorized lookup by ID/key
API -> DB : read current state
DB --> API : authoritative status/stage/actions
API --> Tracker : current record
alt read failure
  Tracker -> Tracker : retain last known; stale label; backoff
else Human chooses cancel
  Human -> Tracker : explicit named cancel
  Tracker -> API : POST cancel
  API -> API : requester authorization and race handling
  API -> DB : reconcile server outcome
  API --> Tracker : actual state
else Human chooses retry after known failure
  Human -> Studio : explicit retry intent
  Studio -> API : new key + validated command context
end
note over Tracker, DB : Closing drawer never cancels. Discovery is not in this durable feed.
@enduml
